{
  "info": {
    "name": "SportsBooks — Booking Flow (Auto-Run)",
    "description": "## Automated End-to-End Booking Flow\n\nHit **▶ Run Collection** and the entire scenario chains automatically:\n\n```\nHealth Check\n  ↓\nRegister Player → Register Partner → Get Profiles → Set Partner Role\n  ↓\nList Venues → (Create Venue if needed) → Generate Time Slots\n  ↓\nBrowse Venues → Get Available Slots → 📝 CREATE BOOKING (pending)\n  ↓\n🔔 Partner Notifications → Pending Bookings → ✅ APPROVE BOOKING (approved)\n  ↓\n🔔 Player Notifications → 💳 CREATE PAYMENT → 💰 CONFIRM PAYMENT (confirmed)\n  ↓\n⭐ MARK COMPLETED (+25 XP) → Verify XP → Payment History → ✅ DONE\n```\n\n### Prerequisites\n- Backend running on `localhost:3000`\n- `DEV_AUTH_BYPASS=true` in `.env`\n- PostgreSQL running with migrations applied\n\n### How to Run\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Import the `SportsBooks - Local Dev` environment\n3. Select the environment in the top-right dropdown\n4. Click **▶ Run Collection** (or right-click → Run Collection)\n5. Watch the console log for the full story\n\nEach request auto-chains to the next via `postman.setNextRequest()`. Variables (IDs, tokens, dates) are passed automatically between steps.",
    "_postman_id": "b1e2f3a4-5678-9abc-def0-1234567890ab",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:3000/api" },
    { "key": "player_token", "value": "test-player-uid-1" },
    { "key": "partner_token", "value": "test-partner-uid-1" },
    { "key": "venue_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "time_slot_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "booking_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "payment_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "player_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "partner_id", "value": "" }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Collection-level: log which step we're on",
          "var step = pm.info.requestName;",
          "console.log('');",
          "console.log('▶ ' + step);",
          "console.log('─'.repeat(50));"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 · Health Check",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Server is running', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('ok');",
              "});",
              "",
              "console.log('✅ Server OK — starting booking flow');",
              "postman.setNextRequest('2 · Register Player');"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:3000/health",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "3000",
          "path": ["health"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2 · Register Player",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "    pm.test('Player registered', function () {",
              "        var d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "        pm.collectionVariables.set('player_id', d.id);",
              "        console.log('🆕 Player registered — ID: ' + d.id);",
              "    });",
              "} else if (pm.response.code === 409) {",
              "    pm.test('Player already exists (OK)', function () {",
              "        pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(409);",
              "        console.log('ℹ️  Player already registered');",
              "    });",
              "}",
              "postman.setNextRequest('3 · Register Partner');"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{player_token}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"displayName\": \"Test Player\",\n  \"email\": \"player@test.com\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "register"]
        }
      }
    },
